Third-party material
--------------------

main/bridge.c, main/eth.c and main/eth.h are derived from the ESP-IDF example
examples/network/sta2eth, Copyright 2023 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD,
licensed "Unlicense OR CC0-1.0".

The firmware is built with ESP-IDF (Apache-2.0, Espressif Systems), including its
bundled cJSON (MIT) and lwIP (BSD-3-Clause) components, and the espressif/mdns
component (Apache-2.0). These are fetched at build time and are not part of this
repository.

The web installer page loads ESP Web Tools (Apache-2.0, Open Home Foundation) from
a CDN when it runs. The browser tests use Playwright (Apache-2.0, Microsoft) as a
development dependency.

Acknowledgements
----------------

The approach to device setup and maintenance is inspired by Tasmota
(https://github.com/arendst/Tasmota) and ESPHome (https://github.com/esphome/esphome).
WiFi Bridge contains no code from either project. Its command names and MQTT topic
layout follow Tasmota's conventions for compatibility. Wi-Fi provisioning over serial
implements the Improv Wi-Fi protocol (https://www.improv-wifi.com/).
